# Go conventions

## Layout

- `cmd/*` — CLI binaries (scrapers, backend, query, verify)
- `internal/strutil` — athlete index key normalization (`Normalize`)
- `internal/worker` — concurrent worker pool for scrapers
- `internal/httpclient` — shared HTTP client

## Scrapers

- Write to `data_ficr/`, `data_federnuoto/`, etc. (gitignored)
- Each competition dir needs `.terminated` when complete
- Use worker pools; log progress; fail loudly on fetch errors

## Aggregator (when present)

- Skips dirs without `.terminated`
- Normalizes events, times, categories, society — see [AGGREGATOR.md](../../AGGREGATOR.md)
- Index key = `strutil.Normalize` on `"Cognome Nome"`

## Backend (`cmd/backend`)

- Redis key schema in [DOCS.md](../../DOCS.md)
- Handlers in `handlers.go`; models in `models.go`; loader in `loader.go`
- Do not add write endpoints without explicit request
- Auth: JWT middleware on protected routes — see [AUTH.md](../../AUTH.md)

## Style

- Standard library + minimal deps; match existing error handling (`log.Fatalf` in mains, return errors in libs)
- Go module: `nuoto` (Go 1.25)
